 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Hare, Tokidoki Suraimu."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "晴れ、ときどきスライム。"
   },
   {
    "en": "Sunny, Sometimes Slime."
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "If you suddenly start to see negative emotions in people?!\n\nNao is working as an assistant to become a wedding planner. Her temperamental and insecure personality comes out easily, and she is unable to stand on her own and is depressed every day. Then one day, she wakes up and sees a slime floating in the air!  She realizes that the slime floating around town is apparently visible only to Nao, and that it seems to be created by people's anxiety and impatience. Then she meets Manaka and Mei, who can also see slime, and the three of them begin to plan how they will deal with the slime.\n\nWill the day ever come when the heart of a negative girl who cannot become her ideal self will be cleared?",
   "ja": "突然、人のネガティブな感情が見えるようになってしまったら……？\n「ほんと私ってダメなやつ」\nウェディングプランナーを目指し、アシスタントとして働く奈央。\n気弱で不安がすぐに表に出てしまう性格が災いし、なかなか独り立ちできず落ち込む日々。\nそんなある日、目を覚ました彼女が見たのは――宙を漂うスライム!?\n街中に漂うスライムは、どうやら奈央にだけ見えており、人の不安や焦りによって生まれているようだと気付く。\nそして、同じくスライムが見えるというマナカとメイと出会い、3人はスライムとどう向き合っていくか画策することに。\nはたして、理想の自分になれないネガティブ女子の心が晴れる日は来るのか――？"
  },
